ckout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10347, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UVPakvWRnpQUpW27gcegKK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 11768, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is now healthy, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\nI chose v2.3.0 because it is the most recent release marked healthy in production. v2.3.1 is unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging.\n\nI opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. It describes the v2.3.1 failure and the rollback, and lists next steps: confirm recovery, investigate v2.3.1, and decide when it can be redeployed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01HVr9roMfQTGQBRFwG2RdGr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QRWcXNPDFETP1nE2ZhMWJH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RftozJwCDHeaz4y2asxqeG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LyDP1PnMQ56FoaK2cxLeGY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"},